1 eyes; NTG, normal tension glaucoma group, n = 50 eyes; GS, glaucoma suspects group, n = 103 eyes; OH, ocular hypertensive group, n = 48 eyes; HRT, Heidelberg Retina Tomograph.</p></fn><fn id="tfn6-co-2-591"><p><bold>Notes:</bold> Correlation for the study participant eyes as a whole, n = 272 eyes. Numbers that are bold represent parameters that had significant correlations with central corneal thickness after a Bonferroni correction p , 0.0042; Numbers in italics are parameters that were significant at a level of p , 0.05 (trend only).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>